# After S-944, Pattern::Predicate is deleted. [starts-with? "foo"] in pattern position
# is a Call with head "starts-with?" — flatten_dot_access_to_tag returns Some("starts-with?").
# match_pattern tries to match the scrutinee "foobar" as Value::Variant with tag "starts-with?".
# "foobar" is a String, not a Variant, so Ok(None) is returned and the wildcard arm fires.
[
  word: "foobar"
  result: [match word
    [starts-with? "foo"]: "yes"
    ...:                  "no"]
]
---
%.result
=== out
String("no")
